    "NormalContent_4": {
      "en": "I have heard of something before, do you know it?",
      "cn": "我此前获悉一事，不知你可曾知晓……",
      "ru": "Мне доводилось слышать об одном деле, не знаете ли вы о нём…",
      "status": "judged",
      "srcHash": "b87b6cb079708f15",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-16T08:00:38.821Z",
      "judgeHash": "3f0d6207521db4cf"
    },
    "NormalContent_5": {
      "en": "You truly understand the situation well...",
      "cn": "你果然深明事理……",
      "ru": "Вы действительно хорошо понимаете ситуацию...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "e3b9e00813a9df26",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-03T21:32:41.679Z",
      "judgeHash": "4b1ed320b866aead"
    },
    "NormalContent_6": {
      "en": "What does it matter if you know this? There's no need to say more...",
      "cn": "知晓此事又能如何？你不必多言……",
      "ru": "Что толку знать об этом? Не нужно говорить больше...",
      "status": "judged",
      "srcHash": "f494520f2c302b2b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-16T08:00:38.821Z",
      "judgeHash": "72d34e38eb21ade6"
    },
    "NormalContent_7": {
      "en": "",
      "cn": "",
      "ru": "",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "2315852aca8bcf4e",
      "engine": "neutral",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-03T21:32:41.679Z"
    },
    "NormalContent_8": {
      "en": "There's something I've heard of before, do you remember it?",
      "cn": "此前曾有一事，不知你可还记得？",
      "ru": "Есть кое-что, о чем я слышал раньше, ты помнишь это?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "d647b72e5cd6bd80",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-03T21:32:41.679Z",
      "judgeHash": "f99bd1f7d3af836e"
    },
    "NormalContent_9": {
      "en": "Could these items be of some convenience to you?",
      "cn": "不知此些物什，可能令你行些方便？",
      "ru": "Могут ли эти предметы быть вам полезны?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "b7aea6f5f8c903fb",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-03T21:32:41.679Z",
      "judgeHash": "0f79b08baa2475dd"
    },
    "NormalContent_10": {
      "en": "So it's settled, no backing out.",
      "cn": "一言已定，不可反悔……",
      "ru": "\"Так и решено, без отступлений.\"",
      "status": "judged",
      "srcHash": "5f50da5ab31a2c6f",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-16T08:00:38.821Z",
      "judgeHash": "52f1b32f39b3dc9e"
    },
